#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: real8-gateway.php
msgid "REAL8 Gateway for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Pasarela REAL8 para WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
#: real8-gateway.php
msgid "https://real8.org"
msgstr "https://real8.org"

#. Description of the plugin
#: real8-gateway.php
msgid ""
"Accept REAL8 token payments on the Stellar blockchain for WooCommerce orders"
msgstr ""
"Acepta pagos en tokens REAL8 en la red Stellar para pedidos de WooCommerce"

#. Author of the plugin
#: real8-gateway.php
msgid "REAL8"
msgstr "REAL8"

#: includes/class-blocks-payment-method.php:39
#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:118
msgid "Pay with REAL8"
msgstr "Pagar con REAL8"

#: includes/class-blocks-payment-method.php:40
msgid "Pay with REAL8 tokens on Stellar."
msgstr "Paga con tokens REAL8 en Stellar."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:47
msgid "REAL8 Payments"
msgstr "Pagos REAL8"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:48
msgid "Accept REAL8 token payments on the Stellar blockchain"
msgstr "Acepta pagos con REAL8 en la blockchain Stellar"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:101
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Activar/Desactivar"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:103
msgid "Enable REAL8 Payments"
msgstr "Habilitar Pagos REAL8"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:104
msgid ""
"Enabling this service sends price requests to api.real8.org and your "
"configured public wallet address to horizon.stellar.org for payment "
"verification. Only USD orders are supported. See the plugin readme for "
"external services and data details."
msgstr ""
"Al activar este servicio se solicitan precios a api.real8.org y se envía tu "
"dirección pública configurada a horizon.stellar.org para verificar los "
"pagos. Solo se admiten pedidos en USD. Consulta el archivo readme del plugin "
"para conocer los servicios externos y los datos enviados."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:108
msgid "REAL8 Wallet redirect"
msgstr "Redirección a la Billetera REAL8"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:110
msgid "Use the optional hosted payment-intent service"
msgstr "Usar el servicio opcional de intenciones de pago alojadas"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:111
msgid ""
"Requires REAL8_PAYMENT_INTENT_SECRET in wp-config.php. Sends the order ID, "
"amounts, public address, memo, expiry and return URL (including the order "
"access key) to api.real8.org, then redirects customers to app.real8.org. "
"Leave disabled to use local payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"Requiere REAL8_PAYMENT_INTENT_SECRET en wp-config.php. Envía el ID del "
"pedido, importes, dirección pública, memo, vencimiento y URL de retorno "
"(incluida la clave de acceso al pedido) a api.real8.org y redirige al "
"cliente a app.real8.org. Déjalo desactivado para usar las instrucciones de "
"pago locales."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:115
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Título"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:117
msgid "Payment method title displayed to customers"
msgstr "Título del método de pago mostrado a los clientes"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:122
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:124
msgid "Payment method description displayed during checkout"
msgstr "Descripción del método de pago mostrada durante el proceso de compra"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:125
msgid "Pay with REAL8. Fast, secure, and low fees."
msgstr "Paga con REAL8. Rápido, seguro y con bajas comisiones."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:129
msgid "Your Stellar Public Key"
msgstr "Su Clave Pública Stellar"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:131
msgid ""
"Your Stellar public key (starts with G) where payments will be received."
msgstr "Tu clave pública de Stellar (empieza por G) donde recibirás los pagos."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:136
msgid "Payment Timeout (minutes)"
msgstr "Tiempo límite de pago (minutos)"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:138
msgid "How long customers have to complete payment. Default: 30 minutes."
msgstr "Tiempo disponible para completar el pago. Por defecto: 30 minutos."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:147
msgid "Price Buffer (%)"
msgstr "Margen de precio (%)"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:149
msgid "Buffer percentage to account for price volatility. Default: 2%."
msgstr "Margen porcentual para la volatilidad del precio. Por defecto: 2%."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:166
msgid "Underpayment Tolerance (%)"
msgstr "Tolerancia de pago insuficiente (%)"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:168
msgid ""
"Allows a small underpayment (percentage of expected token amount) to avoid "
"false negatives caused by rounding/fees. Set 0 to require the exact amount. "
"Hard-capped at 5% to prevent systematic underpayment."
msgstr ""
"Permite una pequeña diferencia respecto al importe esperado por redondeos o "
"comisiones. Pon 0 para exigir el importe exacto. El límite máximo es del 5%."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:178
msgid "Minimum Tolerance (token units)"
msgstr "Tolerancia mínima (unidades del token)"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:180
msgid ""
"Minimum absolute tolerance in the selected token (e.g. 0.05). This is "
"applied if it is larger than the percent tolerance."
msgstr ""
"Tolerancia mínima absoluta en tokens (por ejemplo, 0.05). Se aplica si "
"supera la tolerancia porcentual, con un límite del 5% del importe esperado."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:187
msgid "Show REAL8 prices in shop"
msgstr "Mostrar precios REAL8 en tienda"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:189
msgid "Show REAL8 equivalent next to USD prices"
msgstr "Mostrar equivalente en REAL8 junto a los precios USD"

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:190
msgid ""
"Display REAL8 token equivalents below product prices throughout the shop."
msgstr "Muestra el equivalente en REAL8 debajo de los precios de la tienda."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:234
msgid "Invalid Stellar address. Must be 56 characters starting with G."
msgstr "Dirección Stellar inválida. Debe tener 56 caracteres y comenzar con G."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:279
msgid "REAL8 Payments requires an unpaid USD order and a configured gateway."
msgstr ""
"Los pagos REAL8 requieren un pedido pendiente en USD y una pasarela "
"configurada."

#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:290
msgid "Invalid order access."
msgstr "Acceso al pedido no válido."

