msgstr ""
"No se han podido guardar las instrucciones de pago. Vuelve a intentarlo."

#. translators: 1: amount, 2: asset code, 3: USD price, 4: memo, 5: public address, 6: expiry.
#: includes/class-payment-gateway.php:481
